	(text "Power, after the Timekeeper: 9 V centre-negative on J401 (PJ-063AH, top wall), SMAJ10CA TVS, PMEG3010 series diode, TPS54202 buck to +3V3 (digital), NCP718 to +5V (codec analog and op-amps).\nThe relay coil and the LEDs run from +9V so the audio rails never carry their current."
